{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e187777e1d8acf630995f98f3cb24ee3c676f338ed61918192406a6691cae4ce", "ja": "（老舗着物工房とのタイアップの仕事で、\n紬は着物の仕立て直しを体験させてもらった）", "zh": "（在与老字号和服工坊合作的工作中，紬体验了和服的改制。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f079cee801a6479be9b7097b2bc5d12010b7dfa4495d9870566b72d90a93094b", "ja": "はぁ……。まさか、指示が聞こえないほど\n没頭してしまうとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "唉……没想到会如此投入，甚至连指示都听不见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1240009a9e5a8e404a758107a6b92776e0a609b9858243476e7d94076180447e", "ja": "最初はカメラを意識していましたが、段々、\n作業に集中してしまって。申し訳ありません……。", "zh": "一开始我还在意着镜头，但渐渐地就沉浸在工作里了。真是抱歉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e1ce78747d6116f9b6d4686b2e40b82d3cb917159099980d8cda0b8f1e26e758", "ja": "あまり気にしなくていいと思うよ。真剣に向き合う姿が\nいい！って、スタッフさんにも好評だ。", "zh": "我觉得不用太在意。认真投入的样子很棒！工作人员也都赞不绝口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fcdee82b0c8364f44bf5071492491f62f75e20f6123b96ee62457a3d4d7838c5", "ja": "真剣なのは当然です。着物の中には、代々受け継がれ\n愛されてきた一着、という物もありますから。", "zh": "认真对待是理所当然的。因为有些和服可是世代传承、一直备受喜爱的一件珍品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "305530c9fc3f2c9d5217c3de5f765c653bb78f6b50cb328ce406d5fd9ede3fe4", "ja": "お直しをするにも、敬意をもって……\n細心の注意を払って取り組まないといけません。", "zh": "即使是修改，也必须怀着敬意……  \n一定要极其谨慎地进行才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0a39a0397965fc318f5fb8797fb1a69196e192d1018e403832240b87f0834c79", "ja": "言われてみれば、確かに……。\n着物は、一着を長く着る印象があるな。", "zh": "你这么说，确实……。\n着物给人的印象是一件能穿很久的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bf267e18abe1a73638d9c2867d3dff29e759f01e70b9208ebe9566f9bd236c57", "ja": "そうです。基本的に着物は、年齢や体型に応じて\n仕立て直すことを考えて作られています。", "zh": "没错。一般来说，和服在制作时，基本就考虑到了要根据年龄和体型进行改制。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f1eebd4b6cf09815df6a7b15d4ff1a5be212454ac0def1ac310d6834cc50213f", "ja": "親から子へ、子から孫へ受け継ぐことを考えると\n相手を思いやった服であるとも言えます。", "zh": "考虑到要从父母传给子女，再从子女传给孙辈，也可以说这是一种体贴对方的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1009_p", "source_sha256": "db4c82f376f977f3d6c42d82122724ce7539253a2804dd1114af16ee6f9ef588", "ja": "着物が、その家の歴史にもなってるんだな……。\nなるほど、勉強になったよ。", "zh": "和服也成了那个家庭的历史啊……\n原来如此，我学到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a0ee1a87783442d90609bc4e765034a6b37d8f676bd3eb769ebc25a9e9b738ca", "ja": "これでも呉服屋の娘ですから。", "zh": "毕竟，我也是和服店的女儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0b512f1104a900df8aa444d965ea50e1e7a4ef606cd351e3eec0576c7389ae4f", "ja": "（すごく嬉しそうだ）", "zh": "（看起来特别开心啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f7e3d11ab827545192b960d0b8cfdeed5694cdae7eab0a1aac5c16b9b816a9ee", "ja": "それでは、{$P$}。\n洋裁と和裁の大きな違いは、なんだか分かりますか？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}。\n你知道西式裁缝和日式裁缝最大的区别是什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1b40c0b42c7ddd41d3627b5fcce005de3bd5fca435a076049abe85abfbc969a0", "ja": "えっ！？　よ、洋裁と和裁……？　洋裁は洋服で、\n和裁は着物……って、そういうことじゃないよな？", "zh": "诶！？西、西式裁缝和日式裁缝……？西式裁缝做的是西服，日式裁缝做的是和服……不对，应该不是这个意思吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1014_p", "source_sha256": "52678927f28c75ab4ba904878bc2caba0a2afb167768e53336746b2c730cff3f", "ja": "うーん…………むむむ、降参だ！　教えてくれ。", "zh": "嗯…………唔唔唔，我认输了！告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "077ac00e13a849f8a43867b23c42dc99cf2a92c289083da5878f1f2db1730b43", "ja": "ふふっ、答えは型紙です。洋裁では、型紙に合わせて\n裁断しますが、和裁は型紙を使わなくてもできます。", "zh": "呵呵，答案是纸样。西式裁缝要按照纸样裁剪，但和裁即使不用纸样也能完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d4ac2f80157767de832d5ce6a64ec88854c7ef1145b56d3ca27bbe1aefc517ed", "ja": "布が余った場合も縫い込んでしまえばいいですし、\n無駄がない方法なんですよ。", "zh": "就算布料有多余的，只要缝进去就好，\n是一种毫无浪费的方法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6ac5979fcd2a4d7108c5f4a732d83cc1a678932540411f250086818d7ccbf981", "ja": "へえ～。知らないことばかりだな。\nさすが紬！　呉服屋の美人看板娘！", "zh": "哦～真是尽是些我不知道的事啊。\n不愧是紬！和服店的漂亮招牌女儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3e4822bfe0764c7b50e5262a8f56a3197c750dd203567e1a7db21920763aa8bc", "ja": "……あなたは、私をバカにしているのですか？\nちょっとおだてれば、すぐに喜ぶ人間だと？", "zh": "……你是在把我当傻子耍吗？\n以为稍微奉承两句，我就会沾沾自喜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5d3e1c98663312246f7a670baf70aaa0892ba0ea98bdb6fe87b354c430030573", "ja": "ご、誤解だって！　心から紬を尊敬してるよ。\nもっと着物の話を聞きたいくらいだ！", "zh": "这、这是误会！我是真心尊敬紬的。\n甚至还想再听你多讲一些和服的事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "82861a217d4d3351ed97392651d9d1e412e8a690498e22f4a3c7f2bc3010f50e", "ja": "本当ですか？　今の言葉も怪しいものです。\nですが……そうですね。もっと話を聞きたいと。", "zh": "真的吗？您刚才那番话也很可疑呢。不过……好吧，您说还想再多听一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0444_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c3a41e38b7f8ce03436376c6087d81bcb2a4dccb320d931ab5532044da469db2", "ja": "どうしてもということでしたら……お引き受けします。\n長くなりますから、覚悟してくださいね♪", "zh": "如果您坚持的话……我就接受了。\n因为会说很久，您可要做好心理准备哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
